#. TRANSLATORS: Quest title
#: scenes/dev/basics/teleporter/quest.tres
msgid "Teleporters"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest description
#: scenes/dev/basics/teleporter/quest.tres
msgid "Learn how to use teleporters to go from scene to scene or between two points in the same scene."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/teleporter/teleporter_test_1.tscn
msgid "Continue walking to teleport to another scene!"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/teleporter/teleporter_test_1.tscn
msgid "Teleporting while walking east uses a \"Left to Right Wipe\" transition. When you return, notice how the transition changes to reflect the direction you walk!"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/teleporter/teleporter_test_2.tscn
msgid "Teleportation can also exist between two points in the same scene!"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/teleporter/teleporter_test_2.tscn
msgid "We only give a teleporter a transition if the spawn point is not visible when using it."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/teleporter/teleporter_test_2.tscn
msgid "Each teleporter can reference a SpawnPoint as a target to move the Player to. Add a spawn_point.tscn to your scene and then select it from the teleporter's \"Spawn Point Path\" dropdown in the inspector."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/teleporter/teleporter_test_2.tscn
msgid "You can walk back the way you came to return to the first scene!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest title
#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/quest.tres
msgid "Visuals"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest description
#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/quest.tres
msgid "Learn how to order TileMapLayers, create fake perspective, and maintain logical y-sorting of sprites in your quests."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "In the world of Threadbare, we want a consistent perspective where sprites are layered in a logical order."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "For example, if you walk behind this house, it should appear in front of you!"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "For nodes that appear \"on the ground\", we like to group them under a Node2D with Y Sort Enabled."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Otherwise you get weird visuals! (Try walking right behind this house)"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "We can also create the illusion of elevated cliffs with the elevation_2.tres and shadow.tres tilesets."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Don't be afraid to add more TileMapLayers!"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Be careful with the perspective of elevation. The foam should not be visible off the back."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "This back tile should have an alternate water tile (no collision) to round out the corner!"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "The alternative tiles make it possible to walk above water and stone when using bridges."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Head this way to see an interactive Y-Sort example."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Use the foam_2.tres tileset whenever water contacts land."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Enable Y-Sorting"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Disable Y-Sorting"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Shadows under bridges should reflect elevation. Make sure that the start and end points are consistent."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Activate"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/dev/basics/visuals/visuals_test.tscn
msgid "Deactivate"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character name
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Basics Elder"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Basics Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue:3
msgid "[[Hi|Hello|Greetings]], StoryWeaver. Welcome to Dev Archipelago!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Basics Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue:4
msgid "This is a place of creativity, play, and experimentation!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Basics Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue:5
msgid "While I can't explain all of what happens here, I invite you to learn about the basics of our unraveling world!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Basics Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue:9
msgid "Feel free to explore these islands, however these quests might be a helpful way to start!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Basics Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue:10
msgid "Explore and have fun! I hope to see you again if you need to relearn the basics."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Basics Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue:11
msgid "The people of Threadbare are counting on you. Your understanding of our world is necessary for its survival!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Basics Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue:13
msgid "Excellent choice, your training will surely help with your world-saving efforts."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Basics Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue:14
msgid "Ah, those! Capable of such ingenuity. To do what? I can't quite remember..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Basics Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_basics_elder.dialogue:15
msgid "I'm confident you will know how to use this on your journey."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character name
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Enemy Interaction Elder"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Enemy Interaction Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue:3
msgid "The animals can get jumpy when the void acts up... We will try to wrangle them back to safety!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Enemy Interaction Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue:4
msgid "It's a good idea to learn how to interact with all sorts of creatures in Threadbare, some friendly and some not so much."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Enemy Interaction Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue:5
msgid "Don't let your guard down during these quests!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Enemy Interaction Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue:9
msgid "I understand, it took me a while to be comfortable navigating StoryVore caves."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Enemy Interaction Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue:10
msgid "This is a good place to test your speed and agility when you need it!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Enemy Interaction Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue:11
msgid "When you're ready, these quests will give you a better idea of what you're up against!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Enemy Interaction Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue:13
msgid "Wow, you're brave! Good luck out there."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Enemy Interaction Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue:14
msgid "Move quickly and use hiding spots to your advantage!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Enemy Interaction Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_enemy_interaction_elder.dialogue:15
msgid "Don't forget to pay attention to how creatures move along paths!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character name
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_grapple_elder.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Grapple Elder"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Grapple Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_grapple_elder.dialogue:3
msgid "Welcome to my grapple island, StoryWeaver."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Grapple Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_grapple_elder.dialogue:4
msgid "Did you know that you can hook on to more than just pins? And how do you reckon that sheep got a different string?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Grapple Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_grapple_elder.dialogue:5
msgid "Perhaps these quests may offer you some inspiration on how your grapple can be used!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Grapple Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_grapple_elder.dialogue:9
msgid "Oh well, be sure to return when you are ready to learn about all that is hookable."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Grapple Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_grapple_elder.dialogue:10
msgid "There are many other islands here with fun to be had! Take your time exploring."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Grapple Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_grapple_elder.dialogue:12
msgid "Nice one! I'd be trying this too, if I could only get my string back from those woolly rascals..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Grapple Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_grapple_elder.dialogue:13
msgid "Good luck with your experimenting!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character name
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_intro_islander.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Imagine Islander"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Imagine Islander
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_intro_islander.dialogue:3
msgid "Hi StoryWeaver!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Imagine Islander
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_intro_islander.dialogue:4
msgid "Let me give you some advice for exploring the archipelago."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Imagine Islander
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_intro_islander.dialogue:5
msgid "Whenever you get lost trying out some new mechanics, just open up the game menu and click \"Abandon Quest\". It will bring you right back to the island."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Imagine Islander
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_intro_islander.dialogue:6
msgid "If you stumble across something you like, open the debug settings from the options menu and click \"Open Current Scene In Editor\" to take a closer look at how the scene works."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Imagine Islander
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_intro_islander.dialogue:7
msgid "One more thing. Sometimes helpful information appears in the editor but isn't included on the signs. In the editor, you can right-click a node and choose \"Open Documentation\" to get more details."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Imagine Islander
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_intro_islander.dialogue:8
msgid "Good luck and let your imagination lead you!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character name
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_level_design_elder.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Level Design Elder"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Level Design Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_level_design_elder.dialogue:3
msgid "[[Hi|Hello|Greetings]], StoryWeaver. Welcome to the wondrous world of level design!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Level Design Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_level_design_elder.dialogue:4
msgid "If you've made it this far, I expect you have some imagination you are itching to put to use."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Level Design Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_level_design_elder.dialogue:5
msgid "These quests will show you some of the building blocks for creating your own level."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Level Design Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_level_design_elder.dialogue:9
msgid "Very well, these will always be here when you need them."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Level Design Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_level_design_elder.dialogue:10
msgid "Good luck exploring the rest of the archipelago!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Level Design Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_level_design_elder.dialogue:12
msgid "Excellent! Before you start messing about with mechanics, it's important to have a well designed area for your adventure to take place."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Level Design Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_level_design_elder.dialogue:13
msgid "Please let me know when you've put this to good use, I love seeing it work!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: Level Design Elder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_level_design_elder.dialogue:14
msgid "Some of Threadbare's finest quests use this!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character name
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_repel_elder.dialogue
msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "RepElder"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: RepElder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_repel_elder.dialogue:3
msgid "[[Hi|Hello|Greetings]], StoryWeaver. I see you have decided to explore!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: RepElder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_repel_elder.dialogue:4
msgid "Oh, the sheep? They've been at this for hours, I'm tired just watching them."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: RepElder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_repel_elder.dialogue:5
msgid "I wonder how they learned how to play like that... anyhow, repelling is a skill everyone should try at least once."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: RepElder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_repel_elder.dialogue:9
msgid "The archipelago is full of opportunities to play and be inventive. I trust you will use it wisely."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: RepElder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_repel_elder.dialogue:10
msgid "You don't find me repellent, do you? If you change your mind, my quests are always available for you to practice."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: RepElder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_repel_elder.dialogue:11
msgid "Explore and have fun! I hope to see you again if you find yourself forgetting how powerful repel can be."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: RepElder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_repel_elder.dialogue:13
msgid "Nice one, that will certainly be fun to play with."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Character: RepElder
#: scenes/dev/components/dev_archipelago_repel_elder.dialogue:14
msgid "Good luck teaching the sheep how to do that!"
msgstr ""

