msgid "Something in this scene will throw projectiles at you. The goal is to redirect them toward the targets."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/quests/template_quests/NO_EDIT/2_NO_EDIT_combat/NO_EDIT_combat_components/NO_EDIT_combat.dialogue:5
msgid "Explore the Scene Tree to add, change, or remove elements."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/quests/template_quests/NO_EDIT/2_NO_EDIT_combat/NO_EDIT_combat_components/NO_EDIT_combat.dialogue:9
msgid "You can add text here after the player takes the collectible. Be creative with this one!"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/quests/template_quests/NO_EDIT/3_NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle/NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle.dialogue:3
msgid "This scene includes objects that the player must tap in a particular sequence, and signs with clues on them."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/quests/template_quests/NO_EDIT/3_NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle/NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle.dialogue:4
msgid "Select a \"SequencePuzzleStep\" node and change the array in the \"Sequence\" field."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/quests/template_quests/NO_EDIT/3_NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle/NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle.dialogue:5
msgid "The first melody is set to yellow, green, blue. This means that you should tap those objects in that order."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/quests/template_quests/NO_EDIT/3_NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle/NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle.dialogue:6
msgid "Can you guess the second sequence without looking at the Inspector?"
msgstr ""

#: scenes/quests/template_quests/NO_EDIT/3_NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle/NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle.dialogue:9
msgid "Well done! You can add more steps to the puzzle. Just remember to add them to the \"SequencePuzzle\" node, and add a new hint sign for each one."
msgstr ""

#: scenes/quests/template_quests/NO_EDIT/3_NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle/NO_EDIT_sequence_puzzle.dialogue:10
msgid "Using what you've learned so far, what kind of challenge can you create here? Have fun!"
msgstr ""

